# Copy to .env (gitignored) to point builds at a sync backend. Both must be set
# or neither takes effect — an unconfigured client simply hides the sync action.
#
# SYNC_URL is the origin serving /sync and /export.csv, with a trailing slash.
# It must be reachable *from the device*: Android blocks cleartext HTTP, and on
# the web anything but a secure context has no storage to sync in the first
# place. The deployed Worker serves the PWA from this same origin, so there is no
# cross-origin request and no CORS preflight.
SYNC_URL=https://track-sync.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/

# The whole security boundary — a long random string, never committed. It is
# write-only on the server (`wrangler secret put SYNC_TOKEN`), so it cannot be
# read back: keep the only copy somewhere durable.
SYNC_TOKEN=
